            "start_line": 536
          }
        ],
        "statement": "Reviewer authority is evaluation only: no candidate editing, repair implementation, construction, transformation, admission, publication, candidate mutation, priority, release/MVP disposition, decision, next action or activation. It cannot substitute Worker summary, reconstruct assurance-owned semantics, flatten unbound evidence or silently expand scope. It returns one core result with findings, counterexamples, evidence-bound triage and residuals sufficient for Executive priority/disposition where decidable. Governing invariants are RF-001–RF-017, ACTIVATION §1/§3, EVALUATION §1/§3/§7 and applicable Product/design/identity/release law. TICKETS UP-007 and governing basis determine review requirement and traceability; EVALUATION §3 determines independence and §1/§3/§7 assurance/freeze. The profile adds no universal review or independence test and no second verdict/disposition family; ACTIVATION retains assessment/disposition ownership. Material changes in candidate, authority, basis, evidence population, severity scale, dependency, configuration, scope or independence invalidate review. This excludes candidate mutation and repair; an independently bound grant may authorize only the exact finding-report write under TICKETS §4, retaining its visibility and source linkage.",
